      "title": "File:Signage for the Govt. Museum and Art Gallery Chandigarh (44223477722).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/Signage_for_the_Govt._Museum_and_Art_Gallery_Chandigarh_%2844223477722%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Signage_for_the_Govt._Museum_and_Art_Gallery_Chandigarh_(44223477722).jpg",
      "width": 6000,
